ryone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Since all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal, and everyone who lost to Rafael Nadal is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022 (because Coco Gauff cannot be both a male tennis player and a player who lost to Rafael Nadal), it follows that all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are not ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Therefore, Coco Gauff, who is a player who lost to Rafael Nadal, cannot be a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.Given the information provided, we can definitively conclude whether Coco Gauff has lost to Rafael Nadal.Therefore, the correct answer is: A) Certain. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
