s affect the relationship between Basque and the Romance languages.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\n**A) True**\n\nThe statement "Basque is a Romance language" is true because Basque is related to other languages, and thus it can be part of the Romance language family.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
