annot be ugly).\n   - Therefore, Ben is not ugly.\n   - Since Ben is not ugly, he cannot be yellow (because if a cartoon character is yellow, then it is from The Simpsons, and if it is from The Simpsons, then it is loved by children, and if it is loved by children, then it is funny, and if it is funny, it cannot be yellow).\n   - Therefore, Ben is not yellow.\n\n4.**Evaluate Scenario 2: Ben is funny**.\n   - If Ben is funny, then he cannot be ugly (because if a cartoon character is funny, then it is popular, and if it is popular, it cannot be ugly).Therefore, Ben is ugly or yellow.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
